  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Coastal Grace Beach House is a brand-new gem in the exclusive WaterSound West community, offering the perfect blend of luxury, convenience, and coastal charm. Nestled in a gated community with private beach access, guests can take a scenic stroll along a peaceful boardwalk through protected lake dunes, leading to sugar-white sands and crystal-clear waters.<br><br>Designed for unforgettable vacations, this home is fully equipped with everything you need for endless fun. Enjoy a 6-person, street-legal golf cart with Apple CarPlay, 6 bikes, beach chairs, coolers, stand-up paddleboards, boogie boards, skim boards, skateboards, and golf equipment—just arrive and let the adventure begin! (Note; this home has parking for maximum 2 vehicles. Boats are not allowed in the driveway).<br><br>Amenities You'll Love:<br>Private Beach Access – Tranquil, crowd-free, and just a short scenic walk away from the Pool Area. <br>Resort-Style Pool (seasonally heated October-May) – Zero-entry pool & community amenities, just 3 minutes from your door.<br>Mini Golf – On-site course near the pool, with putters & balls provided for guests.<br><br>Whether you're relaxing by the pool, biking along 30A, or enjoying the pristine shoreline, Coastal Grace is your perfect beachside escape!<br><br>You will find everything you need in the property to make the most of your time on the Emerald Coast. We offer a starter kit of premium, eco-friendly guest amenities including Shampoo, Conditioner, Body and Face Soap, Toilet Paper, Facial Tissues, Dish Soap, Dishwasher Pods, Laundry Detergent, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Dish Sponge, Bath Towels, and Bed linens.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
